{
  "id": "夏桀",
  "name": "夏桀",
  "pinyin": "",
  "aliases": [],
  "type": "person",
  "typeConfidence": "medium",
  "description": null,
  "mentions": [
    {
      "bookId": "soushenji",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "entryId": "soushenji-06-02",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "夏桀之时厉山亡，秦始皇之时三山亡，"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "entryId": "chuci-01-07",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "自忘兮，\n\n厥首用夫颠陨。\n\n夏桀之常违兮，\n\n乃遂焉而逢殃。\n"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "entryId": "chuci-03-04",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "饰玉,\n\n后帝是飨。\n\n何承谋夏桀,\n\n终以灭丧？\n\n帝乃降观,"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-03-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "能与之同光者，遇唐虞之时。逮至夏桀、殷纣，燔生人，辜谏者，为炮烙"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 7,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-07-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "德上通，而智故消灭也。\n\n逮至夏桀之时，主暗晦而不明，道澜漫而不"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 15,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-15-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "百里，而立为天子者，有王道也。夏桀、殷纣之盛也，人迹所至，舟车所"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 18,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-18-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "财，而澹一人之欲，祸莫深焉。使夏桀、殷纣有害于民而立被其患，不至"
    }
  ],
  "firstSeen": {
    "bookId": "soushenji",
    "chapterIndex": 6
  }
}
